  "n1": {
   "fill": "orange",
   "maxH": 620,
   "size": 24,
   "text": "PLACEHOLDERS — confirm with Pratik Davda before launch\n\n• Phone / WhatsApp: +91 98765 43210\n• Address: દુકાન નં. ૨૭૦૬, અમરેલી રોડ, ચિતલ – ૩૬૫૬૨૦\n• All prices, specs and stock status\n• Stats: ૧૨+ yrs, ૩,૨૦૦+ deliveries, ૪૫૦+ villages, ૧૨ awards\n• All 5 awards and all 3 testimonials\n• IndiaMART ૫.૦ rating\n• Subsidy amount (૪૦% / ₹૬૦,૦૦૦) — verify on i-Khedut\n\nProduct pictures are the prototype illustrations until real photos arrive.",
   "w": 380,
   "x": 1960,
   "y": 5380
  },
  "n2": {
   "fill": "blue",
   "maxH": 520,
   "size": 24,
   "text": "Behaviour (unchanged from prototype)\n\n• Mobile dock (Call + WhatsApp) slides in once the hero leaves the screen; hidden ≥900 px.\n• Product sheet URL: #p-ID. Back button closes it.\n• WhatsApp message: model name, ID, price, link, then blank “મારું નામ:” and “મારું ગામ:”.\n• Nav collapses below 900 px — on phones the gallery is reached from “વધુ ફોટા જુઓ”.",
   "w": 380,
   "x": 1960,
   "y": 6080
  },
  "n3": {
   "fill": "green",
   "maxH": 760,
   "size": 24,
   "text": "Gallery data — one list the owner edits\n\n{ src: \"photos/lathi-01.webp\",\n  cat: \"delivery\",   // sanedo | impl | delivery | workshop | honours\n  cap: { gu: \"લાઠીમાં ડિલિવરી\", hi: \"लाठी में डिलीवरी\", en: \"Delivered in Lathi\" },\n  product: \"KS-10\",   // optional → shows “આ મોડેલ વિશે પૂછો”\n  youtube: \"VIDEO_ID\" // optional → video tile\n}\n\n• Tiles: 1:1, 12 px radius, wash placeholder while lazy-loading. Export photos ~1200 px WebP, ≤150 KB.\n• Each photo gets #g-N; back button closes the lightbox.\n• Swipe on touch, ← → and Esc on keyboard.\n• Counter uses the locale’s numerals: ૩ / ૨૪.",
   "w": 420,
   "x": 2874,
   "y": 15060
  },
  "n4": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 420,
   "size": 24,
   "text": "Draft Gujarati copy for review\n(new strings not in the prototype)\n\n• Subtitle: વર્કશૉપથી ખેતર સુધી: અમારા સનેડા, ગામેગામ ડિલિવરી અને સન્માનની ઝલક.\n• Empty-state button: બધા ફોટા જુઓ\n• Captions and village labels\n\nHindi and English versions to be written, not machine-translated.",
